      },
      "summary": "数据槽模块，作为CPU、Dcache和Mesh之间的数据通路仲裁与分发中心",
      "subject": "data_slot",
      "explanation": "模块接收来自Dcache、Mesh和CPU的驱动事件，通过内部组件（MutexMerge、SelSplit、cFifo1）进行仲裁和选择，最终将数据分发到CPU、Dcache和Mesh。事件流和自由信号机制表明这是一个基于握手的多源数据通路。",
      "signals": [
        "i_driveFromDcache",
        "i_driveFromMesh",
        "i_drvCpu2Mux",
        "o_driveToCpu",
        "o_driveToDcache",
        "o_driveToMesh"
      ],
      "instances": [
        "cfifo0",
        "MutexMerge",
        "select1"
      ],
      "related_flows": [
        "flow_000_data_slot_i_drvCpu2Mux",
